OL,3,GNEWSARubbish Ruth completes country
OL,4,Awide litter tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 81-year-old anti-littering
OL,7,Fcampaigner has travelled across the
OL,8,Fcountry encouraging people to pick up
OL,9,Frubbish rather than dropping it.
OL,11,FRuth Major from Redruth, Cornwall
OL,12,Fvisited all 39 BBC radio stations in
OL,13,FEngland, across 55 days armed with a
OL,14,Flitter picker and a bus pass,
OL,15,Fcollecting litter and encouraging
OL,16,Fothers to do the same.
OL,18,FAffectionately known as Rubbish Ruth,
OL,19,Fshe has collected litter for 10 years.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
