OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSARubbish Ruth completes country
OL,4,Awide litter tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "We live in a beautiful
OL,7,Fcountry and we should be so ashamed of
OL,8,Fwhat's happening in it. We have
OL,9,Fstunning countryside, probably some of
OL,10,Fthe best in the world, and it's just so
OL,11,Fblighted that I want everybody please
OL,12,Fto try and do their bit, by picking up
OL,13,Frubbish when they see it."
